# Always ship

When a change is done and locally green:

1. Open a PR. Do not ask whether to open one.
2. Wait until CI is green.
3. Self-review the PR diff (leftover debug, secrets, unrelated files, match to the PR body).
4. Squash-merge without asking.

Do not present a "merge locally / open PR / keep as-is" menu for finished work.
